We need you to decide by Friday between two options for the demo on week 14. Option A: we show live flights with the storage that keeps a copy on three computers, which needs 4 to 9 more working days and may still fail. Option B: we show recorded flights with a simpler store, which needs 1 to 2 days and is safe. We recommend option B now and option A after the demo. Why: when one of the three computers restarts, the others sometimes disagree for a moment about which one is in charge, and we have not found the cause yet. No data has been lost in any test.
